  <h2>The $7 Meal Deal — DQ's Best Full-Meal Value</h2>
  <p>The $7 Meal Deal is available all day at participating DQ Grill &amp; Chill locations. It includes:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>1 Entrée</strong> — Original Cheeseburger OR 3-Piece Chicken Strip Basket</li>
    <li><strong>Regular Fries</strong></li>
    <li><strong>Medium Soft Drink</strong></li>
    <li><strong>Small Sundae</strong> (Hot Fudge, Strawberry, or Caramel)</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>How Much Does the $7 Meal Deal Save?</h3>
  <div class="table-wrap"><table class="size-table">
    <thead><tr><th>Component</th><th>Individual Price</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td>Original Cheeseburger</td><td class="price-cell">$6.39</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Regular Fries (small)</td><td class="price-cell">$2.49</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Medium Soft Drink</td><td class="price-cell">$2.11</td></tr>
