      <tr><td><strong>Total individual</strong></td><td class="price-cell"><strong>~$14.48</strong></td></tr>
      <tr><td><strong>$7 Meal Deal</strong></td><td class="price-cell"><strong>$7.00</strong></td></tr>
      <tr><td><strong>Savings</strong></td><td class="price-cell"><strong>~$7.48</strong></td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table></div>

  <h3>$7 Meal Deal Tips</h3>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Choose Strawberry Sundae for fewest calories</strong> — 280 cal vs. 300 for Hot Fudge and 310 for Caramel. All at the same price within the deal.</li>
    <li><strong>The Chicken Strip option gives slightly more protein</strong> — 3-Piece Chicken Strips vs. the Cheeseburger. Both are $7.00.</li>
    <li><strong>Available all day</strong> — unlike some fast-food deals limited to lunch hours, the $7 Meal Deal runs all day at participating locations.</li>
    <li><strong>Verify at your location</strong> — not every DQ carries the $7 Meal Deal at the same price point. Call ahead for road trips.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>The 2-for-$5 Mix &amp; Match — Best for Snack and Light Meals</h2>
  <p>The 2-for-$5 Mix &amp; Match lets you pick any two eligible items for $5.00 total. Eligible items include:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><a href="/items/original-cheeseburger">Original Cheeseburger</a> (normally $6.39)</li>
    <li>2-Piece Chicken Strips (normally $3.49)</li>
    <li><a href="/items/chili-cheese-dog">Chili Dog</a> (normally $3.99+)</li>
    <li><a href="/items/pretzel-sticks-queso">Pretzel Sticks with Zesty Queso</a> (normally $3.99)</li>
    <li><a href="/items/regular-fries">Regular Fries</a> (normally $2.49+)</li>
    <li>Small Sundae (normally $3.49)</li>
    <li>Medium Soft Drink (normally $2.11+)</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>Best 2-for-$5 Combinations</h3>
  <div class="table-wrap"><table class="size-table">
