  <h2>$7 Meal Deal vs. 2-for-$5 — When to Use Each</h2>
  <p>The right deal depends entirely on how hungry you are:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Use the $7 Meal Deal</strong> when you want a complete meal — entrée, fries, drink, and dessert. Four items for $7 is exceptional value for a full DQ meal.</li>
    <li><strong>Use the 2-for-$5</strong> when you want a lighter combo — a snack, a quick lunch, or when you already have a drink and just want a couple of food items.</li>
    <li><strong>Use both at the same table</strong> — if two people are ordering together, one person takes the $7 Meal Deal and the other takes the 2-for-$5. Total spend: $12 for two people with a complete meal each.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Other Value Opportunities at DQ</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>DQ App deals</strong> — The official DQ app frequently offers location-specific discounts and buy-one-get-one deals on Blizzards. Download the app and check before every visit.</li>
    <li><strong>Kids Meal value</strong> — The <a href="/categories/kids-meals">DQ Kids Meal</a> at $4.99 includes four components (entrée, side, drink, cone) that would cost $11–$12 individually. The best value-per-dollar on the entire menu for smaller portions.</li>
    <li><strong>Blizzard of the Month</strong> — DQ frequently offers a featured Blizzard at a discounted price through the app. Check your app monthly for current offers.</li>
    <li><strong>Mini Blizzard for value tasting</strong> — Before committing to a full Blizzard, the Mini ($3.49–$3.99) lets you taste a new flavor for minimal cost. Order a Mini of an unfamiliar seasonal to decide if you want to come back for a Large.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Complete DQ Budget Meal Plan</h2>
  <p>For a complete DQ experience on the tightest budget:</p>
  <ol style="padding-left:1.4rem;line-height:2;">
    <li>Order the <strong>$7 Meal Deal</strong> (Cheeseburger + Fries + Drink + Sundae) — $7.00</li>
    <li>Skip the Large Blizzard — get a <strong>Mini Blizzard</strong> to add a frozen treat — $3.49</li>
    <li>Total: <strong>$10.49</strong> for a complete DQ meal with a Blizzard</li>
  </ol>
  <p>Compared to ordering the same items individually (Cheeseburger $6.39 + Fries $2.49 + Drink $2.11 + Sundae $3.49 + Mini Blizzard $3.49 = $17.97), the $7 Meal Deal saves $7.48 even with the add-on.</p>

